  "title": "The People Behind the Light",
  "summary": "Most of Lumentum’s work is not visible to the people who rely on it. It happens in cleanrooms, labs, fabs, design reviews, and production meetings - in the careful decisions and repeated steps that allow light to carry information across the world.Behind that work are people, and Lumentum’s recognition as one of Newsweek’s America’s Greatest Workplaces in Tech 2026 is their achievement.",
